<title>JAPAN: Japan Oct rubber output for tyres up 4.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Oct rubber output for tyres up 4.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese rubber output for tyres totalled 97,558 tonnes in October, up 4.2 percent from the same month last year and up 4.0 percent from September, the Japan Automobile Tyre Manufacturers' Association said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Domestic rubber shipments in October amounted to 64,522 tonnes, up 2.7 percent from the previous year and up 6.7 percent from September, the industry body said.</p>
<p>Exports of rubber for tyres in October totalled 34,987 tonnes, up 5.1 percent from the same period a year earlier and up 1.9 percent from September, it said.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-7431</p>
</text>
